-- Float32 elaborates AND proves fine now (semantics + solver steps DONE) —
-- `cantor <file>` (bare check mode) verifies this signature for real. But
-- codegen isn't implemented yet, so `cantor run`/`cantor build` on this same
-- file must still be rejected cleanly (see tests/cli/float32.rs), never
-- crash trying to compile it.
main : -> Float32
main() = 3.14f
